{"id":"n14066-1-7","stage":3,"title":"신사 · 绅士","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14066-1-7-1","ko":"옆집 아저씨가 어제 쓰레기를 집 앞에 함부로 버렸어요.","zh":"隔壁家的叔叔昨天把垃圾乱扔在自家门口。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옆집","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}},{"text":"아저씨가","meaning":"大叔，叔叔","explanation":"아저씨：大叔，叔叔；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26237","senseId":"2","lemma":"아저씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아저씨가","audio":"/audio/513d76b7e2455ea840de.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰레기를","meaning":"垃圾","explanation":"쓰레기：垃圾；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"쓰레기","audio":"/audio/2a2c538e4d404f05e7c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29590","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰레기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰레기를","audio":"/audio/afb5dd72ec377c4367a5.mp3"}},{"text":"집","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"함부로","meaning":"随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","explanation":"함부로：随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","readings":[{"term":"함부로","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72466","senseId":"1","lemma":"함부로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함부로","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸어요.","meaning":"扔，丢","explanation":"버리다：扔，丢；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸어요","audio":"/audio/f7e72b053ddd71d15838.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"14cf4d2fee0defcf","term":"아저씨","zh":"大叔，叔叔","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3","entryId":"26237","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼没有老的成年男子。","pronunciation":["아저씨"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"2a2c538e4d404f05","term":"쓰레기","zh":"垃圾","audio":"/audio/2a2c538e4d404f05e7c9.mp3","entryId":"29590","definition":"扫除的灰尘、不能用而扔掉的东西或丢弃的东西。","pronunciation":["쓰레기"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"a57ea17b4197d372","term":"함부로","zh":"随意，随便，乱，大肆，恣意","audio":"/audio/a57ea17b4197d3729e38.mp3","entryId":"72466","definition":"不小心或不假思索而胡乱地。","pronunciation":["함부로"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"扔，丢","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","en